.TH tkuxml n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkuxml
.PP
XML tree viewer. Shows an XML document as a nested tree (element names plus their attributes / text). Parsing is done by \fBtDOM\fR.
.PP
Optional widget. tDOM is an external dependency and is \fInot\fR part of tclutils, so tkuxml is not loaded by the tkutils umbrella. Ensure tdom is installed, then \fBpackage require tkutils::tkuxml\fR.
.SS API
.CS
set w [::tkutils::tkuxml::widget .w ?-height N?]
::tkutils::tkuxml::setXml   $w xmlText    ;# returns root element name
::tkutils::tkuxml::loadFile $w path
::tkutils::tkuxml::getRoot  $w
.CE
.SS Launcher
.CS
tclsh bin/tkuxml.tcl document.xml
.CE
